# Tooling (rtk / caveman / graphify)

## caveman

User skill/rules often at `~/.cursor/skills/caveman` and `~/.cursor/rules/caveman.mdc`.  
Agent replies: terse, technical substance kept. Code/commits/PR bodies stay normal English.

## rtk

If `rtk` on PATH (`~/.local/bin/rtk`): wrap verbose commands — `rtk git …`, `rtk ls …`, `rtk find …`.  
Check: `rtk gain`. See `~/.cursor/rules/rtk.mdc`.

## graphify

CLI may already be installed (`graphify`). Project setup:

```bash
./scripts/graphify-init.sh
# or: uv tool install graphifyy && graphify cursor install && graphify update .
```

Output under `graphify-out/` (gitignored). Prefer graph queries for structural questions when graph exists. Skill: `.cursor/skills/graphify/SKILL.md`.

## ponytail

Optional Cursor/Codex ruleset helper. **Not required** for VoltPulse. See `.cursor/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md` — install only if user asks.
